; the DS records match digest.

; K.ROOT-SERVERS.NET.
RANGE_BEGIN 0 100
	ADDRESS 193.0.14.129 
ENTRY_BEGIN
MATCH opcode qtype qname
ADJUST copy_id
REPLY QR NOERROR
SECTION QUESTION
. IN NS
SECTION ANSWER
. IN NS	K.ROOT-SERVERS.NET.
SECTION ADDITIONAL
K.ROOT-SERVERS.NET.	IN	A	193.0.14.129
ENTRY_END

